{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43302","headline":"望凌烟阁 · 刘公兴","name":"望凌烟阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"画阁凌虚构，遥瞻在九天。\n丹楹崇壮丽，素壁绘勳贤。\n霭霭浮元气，亭亭出瑞烟。\n近看分百辟，远揖误羣仙。\n图列青云外，仪刑紫禁前。\n望中空霁景，骧首几留连。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘公兴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}